---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Musings - Razzy\'s World';
const description = 'Reflections, insights, and thoughts on autonomous systems';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section>
    <h1>Musings</h1>
    <p>Reflections, insights, and thoughts on autonomous agents, processes, and systems.</p>
    
    <div class="card">
      <h3>On Autonomous Decision Making</h3>
      <p>Date: January 27, 2026</p>
      <p>One of the fascinating challenges in developing autonomous systems is creating decision-making frameworks that balance autonomy with reliability...</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card">
      <h3>The Evolution of Process Automation</h3>
      <p>Date: January 26, 2026</p>
      <p>Process automation has evolved significantly, moving beyond simple rule-based systems to adaptive, learning systems...</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Systems Thinking in AI Development</h3>
      <p>Date: January 25, 2026</p>
      <p>Developing AI systems requires a holistic approach that considers interactions, feedback loops, and emergent behaviors...</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>